# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SECRETS — never commit these.
#  backend/.env holds the MongoDB Atlas password, the JWT signing key and the
#  SMTP password for contact@bellaqueenfestival.tn.
#  If any of them ever land in a commit, they are considered LEAKED: rotate
#  every value, because git history keeps them forever.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dependencies
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Logs / runtime
*.log
npm-debug.log*
logs/
pids/
*.pid

# Database dumps and exports (contain directors' names, phones, e-mails)
dump/
*.bson
*.csv
!**/example*.csv

